  "title": "JAGUAR TCS RACING UNVEIL PROTOTYPE JAGUAR I-TYPE 7 AHEAD OF 2024/25 ABB FIA FORMULA E PRE-SEASON TESTING | Jaguar TCS Racing Media Newsroom",
  "description": "Jaguar TCS Racing – reigning ABB FIA Formula E Teams’ World Champions – have unveiled their Season 11 title contender, the Jaguar I‑TYPE 7, in prototype form. While testing ahead of the season‑opener in December, the Jaguar I‑TYPE 7 will showcase a celebratory testing livery depicting Jaguar TCS Racing’s 16‑wins at 11 different venues in Formula E to date.",
